note as BIZ_diagram_43_ads
  BUSINESS PURPOSE
  Models business managers, partner sharing, ad accounts and the campaign hierarchy
  campaign -> ad set -> ad -> creative. Assets, audiences, targeting and pixels are
  separated into module 43A; delivery, insights and billing remain in module 43B.
end note

