note as BIZ_diagram_43b_ads_delivery
  BUSINESS PURPOSE
  The measurement and money side of advertising: per-entity delivery status,
  time-series insights (impressions, clicks, spend, reach, conversions), server-side
  pixel/conversion events with attribution, and ad-account billing (spend charges,
  invoices, budget schedules). Insights and spend are append-only or derived and
  reconcile to accounting via module 42 payments. Shares schema `ads` with module 43.
end note






