note as DEP_diagram_43b_ads_delivery
  Connects to other modules via:
  ads (module 43) anchors, payments.payment_intents (ad_invoices.payment_intent_id),
  accounting.journal_transactions (spend posting), directory.tenants,
  terminology.catalog_concepts. Ingestion of insights/billing from Meta/partner APIs
  runs through integrations (module 12/31) and the messaging outbox (module 35).
end note

note as REC_ADS_DELIVERY_diagram_43b_ads_delivery
  DERIVED + APPEND-ONLY
  insights_daily / delivery_status_snapshots / pixel_events / ad_billing_events are
  append-only (<<LOG>>). ads.ad_accounts.amount_spent and campaign spend are DERIVED
  from insights_daily / ad_billing_events (REC 3.3 — maintain by rollup, reconcile).
  (entity_type,entity_ref_id) is polymorphic across account/campaign/ad_set/ad —
  constrain via value_set. ad_invoices reconcile to billing + accounting via payments.
end note

' ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
' SOURCE CONSOLIDATED: diagram_43c_ads_commerce_catalog.puml
' ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
note as BIZ_diagram_43c_ads_commerce_catalog
  BUSINESS PURPOSE
  Commerce advertising in the Meta / Delivery-Hero style: product catalogs and feeds,
  rule-based product sets, dynamic ads that auto-generate creative per product, collection
  and carousel formats, and catalog-driven retargeting. Lets a pharmacy, diagnostic unit
  or delivery partner promote an inventory of products/services that stays in sync with a
  source feed, with per-product availability, price and localized fields — the foundation
  advertising-at-scale operators expect. No clinical PHI enters catalogs or creatives.
end note





