note as REC_ADS_PRIVACY_diagram_43c_ads_commerce_catalog
  PRIVACY
  Catalogs are commercial product data only — NEVER clinical PHI. source_product_ref links
  a marketing product to an operational SKU/service; no patient data flows here. Dynamic
  ads render per product at delivery; retargeting uses hashed pixel signals (module 43d).
