note as BIZ_diagram_43d_ads_optimization
  BUSINESS PURPOSE
  The optimization and measurement sophistication a Meta / Delivery-Hero advertiser
  expects, beyond the base object graph and delivery insights (43/43a/43b). Adds saved
  audiences and lookalike specs, automated rules (auto-pause/scale/notify), A/B split
  tests and campaign-budget-optimization experiments, custom conversions and value rules,
  offline/CAPI conversion uploads with match reporting, attribution windows, frequency
  capping, and brand-lift studies. All measurement is consent-gated and PHI-free.
end note






