note as DEP_diagram_43d_ads_optimization
  Connects to other modules via:
  ads (43/43a/43b) anchors (ad_accounts, campaigns, ad_sets, ads, tracking_pixels,
  custom_audiences, insights_daily), common.files (offline upload), directory.tenants,
  terminology.catalog_concepts. Automated-rule actions mutate campaigns/ad_sets/ads and
  are journaled to audit; execution runs through the messaging queue (module 35).
end note

note as REC_ADS_PRIVACY_diagram_43d_ads_optimization
  PRIVACY & CONSENT
  offline_conversion_events store only HASHED match keys (never raw PII/PHI). Custom/offline
  conversions and brand-lift are consent-gated (telemetry consent). No clinical data enters
  advertising measurement (ADR public/community PHI isolation).
end note

note as REC_DERIVED_diagram_43d_ads_optimization
  REC 3.3 — DERIVED
  experiment/variant result metrics, offline_conversion_sets.match_rate/matched_events and
  brand_lift_studies.lift_percent are DERIVED from insights/events; recompute on refresh.
  automated_rules.last_evaluated_at set by the scheduler; rule_executions is append-only.
end note

note as HARDENING_diagram_43d_ads_optimization
  REC 3.4 — HARDENING (enforce at DDL)
  - rule_executions / offline_conversion_events: append-only; PARTITION BY recorded_at; retention.
  - experiment_variants: CHECK SUM(traffic_split_percent)=100 per experiment (trigger);
    exactly one is_control=true.
  - frequency_caps: UNIQUE(scope_concept_id, scope_ref_id, time_window_concept_id).
  - custom_conversions: UNIQUE(ad_account_id, name).
  - (variant_ref_type,variant_ref_id) & (scope_concept_id,scope_ref_id) polymorphic -> value_set + trigger.
end note

