note right of server_conversion_events
  META-LIKE CONVERSION PIPELINE
  Browser and server events use the same event_name + event_id for deduplication.
  Delivery is asynchronous, retryable and observable; raw access tokens never live here.
end note

note right of ad_event_data_policies
  HEALTH DATA FIREWALL
  Advertising integrations use an explicit allowlist, purpose of use and consent check.
  Diagnosis, procedure, laboratory/image results and free clinical text are prohibited.
  Blocked payloads retain only hashes and field paths for auditable remediation.
end note

